<title>USA: Laidlaw stake cut by Caisse de depot.</title>
<headline>Laidlaw stake cut by Caisse de depot.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de Depot et placement du Quebec said Monday it has reduced its stake in Laidlaw Inc to 4.79 percent of 15,738,267 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Caisse de Depot said it sold 94,100 shares between July 21 and July 23 at C$23.72 to C$24.46 each.</p>
</text>
